# Minimal compiler test scene.

@cast
remilia = Remilia Scarlet | Head Lady | remilia | neutral:th1
patchouli = Patchouli Knowledge | Librarian | patchouli | neutral:th2

@scene
with
  show remilia at 0.75
  show patchouli at 0.25
end
focus remilia
remilia: Tiny is a dork.

swap patchouli neutral
focus patchouli
patchouli: Reply to this post or your mother will die in her sleep tonight.

none: Tiny is still a dork.
